ng his people, \"We will surely evict you, O Shu'ayb, and those who have believed with you from our city, or you must return to our religion.\" He said, \"Even if we were unwilling\""},"last":{"s":8,"a":40,"ar":"وَإِن تَوَلَّوْا۟ فَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ مَوْلَىٰكُمْ ۚ نِعْمَ ٱلْمَوْلَىٰ وَنِعْمَ ٱلنَّصِيرُ","en":"But if they turn away - then know that Allah is your protector. Excellent is the protector, and Excellent is the helper"}}
